    "body": "Post-merge PathPilot Hub check on the 770MX simulator (PathPilot v2.14.4), 2026-11-14 22:18-22:20 local, file `hub-tests/1670-contour-inside-ramp/pr.nc` (PR head fd559354), T31 1/4 in end mill, length 2.0 in. The tester: \"looks good\". Each level is entered by a ramp along the pocket wall, not a plunge. Example: `G0 ... Z0.0787`, then `G1 X0.0888 Y-0.6624 Z0.0394` and `G1 X-0.6624 Y-0.6624 Z0`, then the wall ring at that depth. The next levels ramp the same way (`G1 X0.0888 Y-0.6624 Z-0.1181` and `G1 X-0.6624 Y-0.6624 Z-0.1575`). The T31 M6 prompt, G43 H31 and S8000 M3 ran as expected. No alarm was seen.",
